<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.number_input.title")}
        description="NumberInput 是 RML 的数字输入框组件。内置步进按钮（+/−），支持 value 双向绑定、placeholder、appearance、disabled、size 等属性，以及 on-change/on-enter/on-focus/on-blur 事件。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>1. 基础用法 + ref 指令</h3>
                <p>通过 ref 引用数字输入框。步进按钮默认步长为 1，点击 +/− 或按 Up/Down 键即可增减值。</p>
                <NumberInput ref="basic_input" />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>2. placeholder + on_change 事件</h3>
                <p>placeholder 设置占位文本，on-change 绑定回调方法。输入或步进时触发 InputEvent::Change，参数为 &amp;Entity&lt;InputState&gt;。</p>
                <p>当前值：{current_value}</p>
                <NumberInput ref="change_input" placeholder="请输入数字" on-change={on_num_change} />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>3. value 双向绑定</h3>
                <p>value={bound_value} 双向绑定：输入框与下方文本同步更新。</p>
                <p>绑定值：{bound_value}</p>
                <NumberInput ref="bound_input" value={bound_value} placeholder="双向绑定" />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>4. disabled 禁用</h3>
                <p>disabled 属性通过绑定切换禁用状态。</p>
                <p>当前状态：{disabled_status_text}</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="切换禁用" on-click={on_toggle_disabled} />
                    <NumberInput ref="disabled_input" disabled={is_disabled} placeholder="禁用态" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>5. 尺寸 size</h3>
                <p>size 属性设置尺寸：xsmall / small / medium / large。点击按钮循环切换尺寸。</p>
                <p>当前尺寸：{size_label}</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="切换尺寸" on-click={on_cycle_size} />
                    <NumberInput ref="sized_input" size={size_value} placeholder="尺寸变体" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>6. appearance 无边框</h3>
                <p>appearance="false" 移除边框和背景，适合嵌入卡片等容器内使用。默认 appearance 为 true（有边框）。</p>
                <div display="flex" gap="12px" align-items="center">
                    <NumberInput ref="bordered_input" placeholder="有边框" />
                    <NumberInput ref="borderless_input" appearance="false" placeholder="无边框" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>

        <template slot="api">
            <h3>NumberInput</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <p>注：NumberInput 的 value 绑定用法与 Input 相同。步进按钮默认内部处理（步长 1）。</p>
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
